OL,3,GNEWSAReduce water use as drought
OL,4,Acontinues, public told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA water company has asked customers to
OL,7,Freduce their usage over the winter
OL,8,Ffollowing the "exceptionally dry"
OL,9,Fsummer and below-average rainfall this
OL,10,Fautumn.
OL,12,FEssex and Suffolk Water provides
OL,13,Fdrinking water to both counties but
OL,14,Fsaid it was escalating its drought
OL,15,Fresponse as its reservoirs were at
OL,16,F"critically low" levels.
OL,18,FIt said the temporary hosepipe ban
OL,19,Fbrought in on 3 August - which is still
OL,20,Fin place - helped reduce customer
OL,21,Fdemand by about 7%.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
